{"id":"n90321-1-11","stage":3,"title":"지나치다 · 过分","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n90321-1-11-1","ko":"이 물건은 가격이 지나치게 높은 것 같아.","zh":"我觉得这个东西的价格实在太高了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"물건은","meaning":"东西，物品，物件","explanation":"물건：东西，物品，物件；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"1","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가격이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지나치게","meaning":"过分，过度","explanation":"지나치다：过分，过度；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지나치다","audio":"/audio/86b6476536bae9677938.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"90321","senseId":"1","lemma":"지나치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"높은","meaning":"贵，高","explanation":"높다：贵，高；은：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"높다","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64523","senseId":"5","lemma":"높다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"것","meaning":"东西，事，的","explanation":"것：东西，事，的","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"1","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같아.","meaning":"好像，可能","explanation":"같다：好像，可能；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"8","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"东西，物品，物件","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"具有一定形状的某种物质。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"86b6476536bae967","term":"지나치다","zh":"过分，过度","audio":"/audio/86b6476536bae9677938.mp3","entryId":"90321","definition":"超出一定的标准，程度严重。","pronunciation":["지나치다"]},{"id":"5601621a4a648d5b","term":"높다","zh":"贵，高","audio":"/audio/5601621a4a648d5bc309.mp3","entryId":"64523","definition":"价格或比例在普通程度之上。","pronunciation":["놉따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"东西，事，的","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"泛指各种事物或事情。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"好像，可能","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"推测出结果。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/140292615b8498a17869.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n90321-1-11-2","ko":"응, 품질에 비해 가격이 너무 비싸.","zh":"是啊，以它的质量来看，价格实在太贵了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응,","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품질에","meaning":"品质，质量","explanation":"품질：品质，质量；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"품질","audio":"/audio/ce22e94483cb4fbf1920.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88645","senseId":"1","lemma":"품질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비해","meaning":"比起","explanation":"비하다：比起；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"비하다","audio":"/audio/f5d55c30842200d89171.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15641","senseId":"2","lemma":"비하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"가격이","meaning":"价格，价钱","explanation":"가격：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"가격","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62450","senseId":"1","lemma":"가격","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너무","meaning":"太","explanation":"너무：太","readings":[{"term":"너무","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28183","senseId":"1","lemma":"너무","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"비싸.","meaning":"贵","explanation":"비싸다：贵；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"비싸다","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66318","senseId":"1","lemma":"비싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"ce22e94483cb4fbf","term":"품질","zh":"品质，质量","audio":"/audio/ce22e94483cb4fbf1920.mp3","entryId":"88645","definition":"物品的性质和质地。","pronunciation":["품ː질"]},{"id":"f5d55c30842200d8","term":"비하다","zh":"比起","audio":"/audio/f5d55c30842200d89171.mp3","entryId":"15641","definition":"以某个基准来判断时，比那个基准更加。","pronunciation":["비ː하다"]},{"id":"38c1b40757a204e5","term":"가격","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/38c1b40757a204e578e9.mp3","entryId":"62450","definition":"用钱表示的物品的价值。","pronunciation":["가격"]},{"id":"b039867287707963","term":"너무","zh":"太","audio":"/audio/b0398672877079631cf2.mp3","entryId":"28183","definition":"已超过一定的程度或限度的状态。","pronunciation":["너무"]},{"id":"063c1a7bb93233dc","term":"비싸다","zh":"贵","audio":"/audio/063c1a7bb93233dcd205.mp3","entryId":"66318","definition":"物品的价格或做某事所花的费用高于一般水平。","pronunciation":["비싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/05e7680594ce53cf1127.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.985,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=90321","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourc